SUMMARY:Summer Camp at Corn Cob Acres
DESCRIPTION:Camp CCA is a day camp experience for ages 5-10 that runs from 8:30am till 4:30pm Monday through Friday each offered week. Campers will join a group for the week led by a certified PA Educator along with our incredible Camp CCA counselors. No two camp days are the same. Campers may spend their days mining for gems\, exploring our new Cornelius Magical Scavenger Hunt\, building confidence through Reading to Succeed\, Cooling off with the popular “water day”\, and creating a special craft. Every day will be full of fun\, educational and supervised play around Corn Cob Acres. \nParent Testimonial\n“Our son has attended summer camp at CCA for the past 3 summers. He absolutely loves it and looks forward to those weeks each summer! The kids can enjoy all that CCA has to offer\, and they have additional fun\, learning activities for the kids each day. The camp leaders have been super engaging with our son and always make sure he feels comfortable! We love summer camp at CCA! -Sara S \nWeek 1 – June 22-26\, 2026\nWeek 2 – July 20-24\, 2026\nOur counselors all have an education background and have been properly vetted and trained in safety measures and emergency situations. All programming aligns with PA State Standards\, and is created by staff with experience in education. \n\nAdditional Fun Things for Kids To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nSummer Camps\nPetting Zoo\nRailroad Attractions\n\n\n\nFun on the Farm\nAmusement Parks\nMini Golf\n\n\n\nArcades & Video Games\nZip-Lines\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Summer Camps offered throughout Lancaster County this summer!
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/summer-camp-corn-cob-acres/
LOCATION:Corn Cob Acres\, 191 College Avenue\, Mountville\, PA\, 17554\, United States
CATEGORIES:Children & Family events,Summer Camp
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lancasterpa.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/Corn-Cob-Acres-Event-Summer-Camp.png
END:VEVENT
