SUMMARY:Discovery Lab: Builders Lab - Tiny Town Summer Camp
DESCRIPTION:Discovery Lab Kids Camp at Tiny Town is where curious kids get to ask questions\, try ideas\, and see what happens next! Offering 10 years of the best kids camp in Lancaster County – full of hands-on\, STEAM powered activities! \nDesigned for children ages 4 to 8\, this summer experience goes beyond by turning each week into a hands-on lab filled with investigation\, experimentation\, and creative challenges. Campers explore real-world concepts through Science\, Technology\, Engineering\, Arts\, and Math as they build\, test\, design\, and problem-solve together. It’s an engaging summer of discovery that blends learning\, creativity\, and teamwork in a way kids love and parents value. \n\nAdditional Fun Things for Kids To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nSummer Camps\nPetting Zoo\nRailroad Attractions\n\n\n\nFun on the Farm\nAmusement Parks\nMini Golf\n\n\n\nArcades & Video Games\nZip-Lines\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Summer Camps offered throughout Lancaster County this summer!
