SUMMARY:Stormers Player Run Camps at Penn Medicine Park
DESCRIPTION:Led by current Stormers players\, this camp is perfect for young athletes ages 7-12 looking to sharpen their skills with pro-level coaching. Participants will focus on hitting\, fielding\, throwing and base running through hands-on instruction\, fun drills\, and competitive games. \nJoin us for an exciting\, skill-building baseball camp where players of all levels will enhance their abilities in every aspect of the game! Participants will focus on key fundamentals such as hitting\, pitching\, fielding\, base running\, and throwing. Through instruction from the Stormers coaching staff and fun drills\, players will progressively build their skills and gain confidence on the field\, setting the foundation for success in competitive play. Train like the Stormers! \nRuns: 9:00 am – 12:00 Noon \n*June 25  will end at 1pm. Athletes will have lunch and play arcade games in the Silverball Room to celebrate the end of camp. \n\nAdditional Fun Things for Kids To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nSummer Camps\nPetting Zoo\nRailroad Attractions\n\n\n\nFun on the Farm\nAmusement Parks\nMini Golf\n\n\n\nArcades & Video Games\nZip-Lines\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Summer Camps offered throughout Lancaster County this summer!
URL:https://lancasterpa.com/events-calendar/stormers-player-run-camps-penn-medicine-park/
