SUMMARY:Refton Fire Company Mud Sale
DESCRIPTION:Come join us for our biggest fundraiser of the year and bring home some items you can enjoy too! We plan an having a good selection of quality items including flowers\, antiques\, poly lawn furniture\, furniture\, tools\, equipment and much more.  We will also be having a Friday evening sale at 5pm selling flowers and crafts until around 8pm.\n\nWe will have lots of homemade food\, ice cream\, milkshakes\, ext.\n  \nThe Refton Fire Company Mud Sale falls on the Last Friday & Saturday of June every year. \n\nMud Sales are a unique Lancaster County tradition to raise funds for local volunteer fire companies. See our complete schedule of Lancaster County mud sales. \nPlease Note: Many of the Fire Companies holding mud sales can always use extra help on the days they receive items and the day of the event.  It takes a LOT of labor to put on a mud sale.
