SUMMARY:4th Friday in Columbia
DESCRIPTION:Come Explore Downtown Businesses!\nThanks to the Merchants Association of Columbia\, we host 4th Friday themed events downtown. Shops stay open later\, food and drink specials are everywhere\, and fun and prizes can be found if you look! Follow the MAC on Facebook to see what’s happening this month. \nEvent Calendar for Lancaster\, PA »\n(click here) \n\nCheck below for a calendar of the upcoming Friday events:\n\nFirst Fridays in Lancaster City\nFirst Friday in Mt. Gretna\nFirst Saturday in Ephrata\nThird Fridays are Music Fridays in Lancaster\nFourth Friday in Mount Joy\nFourth Saturday in Columbia\n\nSee our monthly Calendar of Friday Events for descriptions of each. \n\nAdditional Fun Things To Do in Lancaster?\n\n\nKids’ Attractions\nFamily Attractions\nAmish Attractions\n\n\n\nThings To Do for Adults\nHistorical & Educational\nIndoor Things To Do\n\n\n\nTheater\, Music\, & The Arts\nMud Sales\nEvents Calendar\n\n \nTake a look at many more Things To Do throughout Lancaster County!
